<title>USA: Neurogen starts Phase 1 trials of 2 drugs.</title>
<headline>Neurogen starts Phase 1 trials of 2 drugs.</headline>
<dateline>BRANFORD, Conn. 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Neurogen Corp said Thursday that Phase I human clinical testing had begun for two of its drugs: NGD 91-2, a non-sedating candidate for treating anxiety, and ADCI, a candidate for treating epilepsy.</p>
<p>It said the test for NGD 91-2 is being undertaken by Pfizer Inc, while that for ADCI is being done by Wyeth-Ayerst Laboratories, a division of American Home Products Corp.</p>
